Z||000000||JohnnyK||12-04-2000||08:12 PM||||If this is handy for anyone, could someone push on the sides of their thermostat cap (it's a 2.5) and see if you can wiggle it with moderate force (push down on one side, and the other goes up). The cap is new, and the housing is fairly clean, and the thermostat isn't in the way. Any idea?||||reg||1
Z||000001||batboy||12-04-2000||08:49 PM||||They're spring-loaded. You have to push down on them and then turn to remove them. Sort of like a child-safety cap on medicine.||||reg||1
