Z||000003||JohnnyK||12-04-2000||11:16 PM||||What? That doesn't help me at all. I'm asking if there is supposed to be some "play" in it. ie: You push down on one side, and the other side comes up a tiny bit. I know how to get them on, I'm just wondering if thats normal, or it should be on there rock hard (don't say rock hard until you check, please.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000004||Standard||12-05-2000||02:31 AM||||Well, the cap on my V6 doesn't have any play, but I also have to use a big pipe wrench to get it off, which probably means it's time for a new one.  I think the most important thing is that it doesn't leak.  ||||reg||1
